# The build context is this directory, but keep it deliberately sterile.
# Helena Framework code, CT, model checkpoints, results, credentials and caches are
# always mounted at runtime; none may be copied into an image.
#
# Every Containerfile, and every file a Containerfile COPYs, must be whitelisted
# below. `campaignx-surface-qc:0.1.1` ran QC in production while
# Containerfile.surface-qc and requirements.surface-qc.txt (COPYed at
# Containerfile.surface-qc:25) were both excluded by the `*` rule, which made
# that image unbuildable from this repository. See FIX-16.
#
# Do not whitelist a path that does not exist in this directory: compose.yaml,
# README.md and runtime-contracts.md were listed here and never existed, which
# made the whitelist read as a contract it was not enforcing.
*
!Containerfile.vc3d
!Containerfile.panel
!Containerfile.ink
!requirements.ink.txt
!Containerfile.ink-worker
!requirements.ink-worker.txt
!Containerfile.surface-qc
!requirements.surface-qc.txt
!Containerfile.qc
!Containerfile.orchestrator
!Containerfile.scrollfiesta
!Makefile
!base-images.env.example
!.dockerignore
